                note: "On ESP32-H2 VBAT is not a backup-only input: without a backup cell it is one of the analog supply pins (3.0-3.6 V) and must be stable before CHIP_EN goes high. An internal switch powers GPIO12, GPIO13 (XTAL_32K_P) and GPIO14 (XTAL_32K_N) from either VBAT or VDDA_PMU.",
